+            "wandb.Api()) or export WANDB_API_KEY. To launch without live "
+            "telemetry, pass --wandb-mode offline or --log-mode debug explicitly; "
+            f"the outage is then recorded in the run's {ATTEMPTS_FILE}."
+        )
+    return source
